+// ---- Vollie c2 (patches/llama.cpp-c2/0003): 4-row Q3_K dot for the un-repacked MUL_MAT_ID path. Ported from campaign 1
+// (patches/llama.cpp/0001-cpu-runtime.patch: GGML_Q3K_X4 + GGML_Q3K_ILP, GGML_Q3K_KERN), knob VOLLIE_Q3K_X4 (read in
+// ggml-cpu.c; 0 = off). Four Q3_K rows (stride bx) against one Q8_K row: every row's integer block sum is exact and its
+// float step is the stock one (d = y.d * fp16(x.d); sum += d * isum, block by block in order), so s[r] equals
+// ggml_vec_dot_q3_K_q8_K's result for that row to the bit.
